        "TileImage": "$($repository 37404add-fbf0-4698-9712-50ced4f4b46c).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Today you need to go back to the New York bank because our client needs more information about the building&apos;s floor plans and data. Also, some other group has planned to do a robbery in the middle of this chaos, and so today we also have two targets who go by the names Gourd and Sugar squirrel. You need to rob the client for two papers, called &quot;IT Note&quot; and &quot;Letter of termination&quot; you can find these in the rooms called &quot;Stock market&quot; and &quot;Security hub&quot;. Good luck 47. Have fun!",
